s_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.7.stable, 4.5.stable\n\nI haven't tested on more versions but I guess it also happens.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.stable (8fe6f198d) - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 3 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060 (NVIDIA; 32.0.16.1047) - AMD Ryzen 5 5600G with Radeon Graphics (12 threads) - 31.89 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen creating plugins to export for other platforms, when adding the export options for other platforms we can do something like:\n\n```cpp\nr_options->push_back(ExportOption(PropertyInfo(Variant::CALLABLE, \"application/generate_metadata\", PROPERTY_HINT_TOOL_BUTTON, \"Generate Metadata\", PROPERTY_USAGE_EDITOR), Callable(this, \"generate_metadata\")));\n```\n\nThis creates a button and calls the generate_metadata function when clicking it, but after saving, the property gets serialized and the Callable instance gets lost.\n\nIn this case I haven't specified the PROPERTY_USAGE_STORAGE flag, which according to the documentation is the one that enables the serialization, therefore in this case the application/generate_metadata shouldn't even get serialized and stored.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open the export_plugin.cpp file for any platform\n2. Add the following line inside the get_export_options() method:\n  ```cpp\n  r_options->push_back(ExportOption(PropertyInfo(Variant::CALLABLE, \"asdfasdf/generate_metadata\", PROPERTY_HINT_TOOL_BUTTON, \"Generate Metadata\", PROPERTY_USAGE_EDITOR), Callable()));\n  ```\n3. Compile and open Godot\n4. Generate the export options for the platform you modified and save them\n5. On the export options file you should see a line like so:\n  ```\n  asdfasdf/generate_metadata=Callable()\n  ```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nThis file is the export_plugin for windows on the commit with tag 4.7-stable, unzip and move this file to: platform/windows/export/export_plugin.cpp:\n[export_plugin.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29442395/export_plugin.zip)\n\nAfter compiling you'll be able to reproduce the issue described.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120720/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120720/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}